# Title: Renamed Microsoft Teams Execution
# ID: 88f46b67-14d4-4f45-ac2c-d66984f22191
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2024-07-12
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects the execution of a renamed Microsoft Teams binary.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((OriginalFileName:"msteams.exe" OR OriginalFileName:"teams.exe")) AND -(((process_name:*\\msteams.exe OR process_name:*\\teams.exe))))
